---------
g0: $ k ≐ k $ by ceqt_refl
g1: $ j ≐ j $ by ceqt_refl
g2: $ v ≐ v $ by ceqt_refl
g3: $ fsb A k j v ≐ fsb B k j v $ by fsb_congr [#1, g0, g1, g2]
g4: $ cgr3 k j v (fsb A k j v) ≐ cgr3 k j v (fsb B k j v) $ by cgr3_congr [g3]
g5: $ ω ≐ ω $ by ceqt_refl
g6: $ fsf A ≐ fsf B $ by trc_congr [g5, g4]

