l115: $ G , x1 = suc ∅ , x2 = scons p (scons q ∅) , x3 = ccom (fsf A) x2 , a ∈ fv (fsf A) p → a ∈ fv (fsf A) q ⇒ a ∈ fv (fsf A) ⟨ suc ∅ , scons p (scons q ∅) ⟩ $ by wcel_eq_r [eq_sym [l114], welc_wcel [l113]]
l116: $ G , x1 = suc ∅ , x2 = scons p (scons q ∅) , x3 = ccom (fsf A) x2 ⇒ (a ∈ fv (fsf A) ⟨ suc ∅ , scons p (scons q ∅) ⟩) ↔ (a ∈ fv (fsf A) p → a ∈ fv (fsf A) q) $ by bi_intro [l98, l115]
l117: $ G , x1 = suc ∅ , x2 = scons p (scons q ∅) ⇒ functional (fsf A) $ by weaken [l3]
