l82: $ G , x1 ⊆ ω × trees ω , z ∊ fmop x1 ⇒ z ∊ ω × trees ω ∧ ∃ m (m ∊ ω ∧ (z = ⟨ m , ⊥ₒ ⟩ ∨ ∃ p ∃ q (z = ⟨ m , p →ₒ q ⟩ ∧ ⟨ m , p ⟩ ∈ x1 ∧ ⟨ m , q ⟩ ∈ x1) ∨ ∃ p (z = ⟨ m , ∀ₒ p ⟩ ∧ ⟨ suc m , p ⟩ ∈ x1) ∨ ∃ x4 ∃ x5 (x4 ∊ m ∧ x5 ∊ m ∧ (z = ⟨ m , x4 =ₒ x5 ⟩ ∨ z = ⟨ m , x4 ∈ₒ x5 ⟩)))) $ by cab_elim [l81]
l83: $ G , x1 ⊆ ω × trees ω , z ∊ fmop x1 ⇒ z ∊ ω × trees ω $ by and_elim_l [l82]
l84: $ G , x1 ⊆ ω × trees ω ⇒ fmop x1 ⊆ ω × trees ω $ by subset_intro [l83]
l85: $ G ⇒ bounded x (fmop x) (ω × trees ω) $ by bounded_intro [l84]
l86: $ G , d = ω × trees ω , z ∊ fmop x ⇒ z ∊ fmop x $ by ax
l87: $ G , d = ω × trees ω , z ∊ fmop x ⇒ z ∊ ω × trees ω ∧ ∃ m (m ∊ ω ∧ (z = ⟨ m , ⊥ₒ ⟩ ∨ ∃ p ∃ q (z = ⟨ m , p →ₒ q ⟩ ∧ ⟨ m , p ⟩ ∈ x ∧ ⟨ m , q ⟩ ∈ x) ∨ ∃ p (z = ⟨ m , ∀ₒ p ⟩ ∧ ⟨ suc m , p ⟩ ∈ x) ∨ ∃ x4 ∃ x5 (x4 ∊ m ∧ x5 ∊ m ∧ (z = ⟨ m , x4 =ₒ x5 ⟩ ∨ z = ⟨ m , x4 ∈ₒ x5 ⟩)))) $ by cab_elim [l86]
l88: $ G , d = ω × trees ω , z ∊ fmop x ⇒ z ∊ ω × trees ω $ by and_elim_l [l87]
l89: $ G , d = ω × trees ω ⇒ fmop x ⊆ ω × trees ω $ by subset_intro [l88]
l90: $ G , d = ω × trees ω ⇒ d = ω × trees ω $ by ax
l91: $ G , d = ω × trees ω ⇒ fmop x ⊆ d $ by subset_trans [l89, eq_subset [eq_sym [l90]]]
