l11: $ G , v ⊆ lfp x (fmop x) , v ⊆ {y | y ∊ ω × trees ω ∧ ∀ n ∀ c (y = ⟨ n , c ⟩ → ∀ r ∀ e ∀ a (r ∊ fseq u → e ∊ fseq (trees ω) → a ∊ fseq (fv uni (suc ∅)) → cdm e = n → ∀ i (i ∊ n → fv r (fv nvf (fv e i)) ∈ psv u w b ∧ fv a i = fv (pcol u w b) (fv r (fv nvf (fv e i)))) → (∅ ∈ dt u (mcv hfin) (ltr (enc_expr (pset b)) (enc_expr E) (enc_expr M) c e) w r ↔ ⟪ fv uni (suc ∅) , a ⊨ c ⟫) ∧ dt u (mcv hfin) (ltr (enc_expr (pset b)) (enc_expr E) (enc_expr M) c e) w r ∈ two ∧ ltr (enc_expr (pset b)) (enc_expr E) (enc_expr M) c e ∈ trees ω))} , z ∊ fmop v , z = ⟨ n , c ⟩ ⇒ z = ⟨ n , c ⟩ $ by ax
