pset_truth
----------
l1: $ G ⇒ lfp x (fmop x) ⊆ {y | y ∊ ω × trees ω ∧ ∀ n ∀ q (y = ⟨ n , q ⟩ → ∀ r ∀ e ∀ a (r ∊ fseq u → e ∊ fseq (trees ω) → a ∊ fseq (fv uni (suc ∅)) → cdm e = n → ∀ i (i ∊ n → fv r (fv nvf (fv e i)) ∈ psv u w b ∧ fv a i = fv (pcol u w b) (fv r (fv nvf (fv e i)))) → (∅ ∈ dt u (mcv hfin) (ltr (enc_expr (pset b)) (enc_expr E) (enc_expr M) q e) w r ↔ ⟪ fv uni (suc ∅) , a ⊨ q ⟫) ∧ dt u (mcv hfin) (ltr (enc_expr (pset b)) (enc_expr E) (enc_expr M) q e) w r ∈ two ∧ ltr (enc_expr (pset b)) (enc_expr E) (enc_expr M) q e ∈ trees ω))} $ by fo_main [pr_1 [#1], pr_2 [#1], pr_3 [#1], pr_4 [#1], pr_5 [#1], pr_6 [#1], pr_7 [#1], pr_8 [#1], pr_9 [#1], #2, #3]
l2: $ G ⇒ ⟨ ∅ , c ⟩ ∈ fmla $ by cab_elim [#4]
l3: $ G ⇒ ⟨ ∅ , c ⟩ ∈ {y | y ∊ ω × trees ω ∧ ∀ n ∀ q (y = ⟨ n , q ⟩ → ∀ r ∀ e ∀ a (r ∊ fseq u → e ∊ fseq (trees ω) → a ∊ fseq (fv uni (suc ∅)) → cdm e = n → ∀ i (i ∊ n → fv r (fv nvf (fv e i)) ∈ psv u w b ∧ fv a i = fv (pcol u w b) (fv r (fv nvf (fv e i)))) → (∅ ∈ dt u (mcv hfin) (ltr (enc_expr (pset b)) (enc_expr E) (enc_expr M) q e) w r ↔ ⟪ fv uni (suc ∅) , a ⊨ q ⟫) ∧ dt u (mcv hfin) (ltr (enc_expr (pset b)) (enc_expr E) (enc_expr M) q e) w r ∈ two ∧ ltr (enc_expr (pset b)) (enc_expr E) (enc_expr M) q e ∈ trees ω))} $ by wcel_subset [l1, l2]
