l10: $ G , n = N , p = P , q = Q , d = fmla , z = ⟨ n , P →ₒ Q ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ N , P ⟩ ∈ fmla $ by fm_e [l7]
l11: $ G , n = N , p = P , q = Q , d = fmla , z = ⟨ n , P →ₒ Q ⟩ ⇒ Q ∈ fm N $ by weaken [#3]
